{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60011","type":"text","text":"## 学习路径\n\n```\n1. 理解 Encoder-Decoder 结构\n       ↓\n2. 掌握 Skip Connection 原理\n       ↓\n3. 学习 ConvTranspose2d 上采样\n       ↓\n4. 理解 Dice Loss 解决不均衡\n       ↓\n5. 阅读完整训练代码\n       ↓\n6. 对比改进版 vs 经典版\n```\n\n**推荐资源**:\n- B站: 霹雳吧啦Wz UNet 源码解析\n- 论文: U-Net (2015)\n- GitHub: milesial/Pytorch-UNet","x":0,"y":-680,"width":480,"height":510,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60009","type":"file","file":"基于pytorch的深度学习/Deep Learning advance/UNet/UNet 训练代码.md","x":-440,"y":410,"width":350,"height":220,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60002","type":"text","text":"## UNet 经典结构图\n\n```\n输入 [B,3,H,W]\n      |\n      v\n+-----------+\n|  Encoder  |\n| (下采样)  |\n| 64->128   |\n| ->256->512|\n+-----------+\n      |\n      v\n+-----------+\n|Bottleneck |\n|   1024    |\n+-----------+\n      |\n      v\n+-----------+\n|  Decoder  |\n| (上采样)  |\n| 512->256  |\n| ->128->64 |\n+-----------+\n      |\n      v\n输出 [B,1,H,W]\n\n🔗 Skip Connection:\nEncoder 每层特征\n     ↓\n与 Decoder 对应层\ncat 拼接\n```\n\n**U 型对称结构**\n- 左半边：Encoder 下采样提取语义\n- 右半边：Decoder 上采样恢复分辨率\n- 跳跃连接：挽救丢失的边缘细节","x":640,"y":-170,"width":480,"height":1040,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60010","type":"file","file":"基于pytorch的深度学习/Deep Learning advance/UNet/改进unet.md","x":-440,"y":1005,"width":350,"height":395,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60014","type":"text","text":"## 论文经典结构图说明\n\n**UNet 论文 Figure 1** 展示了:\n\n1. **左侧 Encoder**\n   - 蓝色/白色方块\n   - 每层标注通道数\n   - 箭头表示下采样\n\n2. **右侧 Decoder**\n   - 蓝色/白色方块\n   - 箭头表示上采样\n   - 与 Encoder 对称\n\n3. **灰色箭头**\n   - Skip Connection\n   - 复制并裁剪特征图\n   - 通道维度拼接\n\n4. **右下角**\n   - 1x1 卷积\n   - 输出分类结果\n\n**关键创新**:\n- 完全对称的 U 型结构\n- 大量使用 Skip Connection\n- 仅用少量训练数据\n- 获得当时最佳分割效果","x":668,"y":1295,"width":425,"height":700,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60006","type":"text","text":"## 核心组件 4: Skip Connection\n\n```python\n# 关键操作：通道维度拼接\nx = torch.cat([encoder_feat, decoder_feat], dim=1)\n```\n\n**为什么需要?**\n- 下采样丢失空间细节（边缘、纹理）\n- Encoder 保留\"空间精确\"特征\n- Decoder 拥有\"语义丰富\"特征\n- cat 拼接：两者互补，挽救边缘\n\n**维度示例**:\n- enc4: [B, 512, H/8, W/8]\n- up4:  [B, 512, H/8, W/8]\n- cat:  [B, 1024, H/8, W/8]","x":1270,"y":1295,"width":520,"height":435,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60003","type":"text","text":"## 核心组件 1: DoubleConv\n\n```python\nclass DoubleConv(nn.Module):\n    # Conv2d -> BN -> ReLU -> Conv2d -> BN -> ReLU\n    # 每一级编/解码器的最小积木\n    # 保持 3x3 卷积核不变\n```\n\n**作用**:\n- 两次 3x3 卷积提取特征\n- BatchNorm 稳定训练\n- ReLU 激活引入非线性","x":1270,"y":170,"width":520,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60004","type":"text","text":"## 核心组件 2: Encoder\n\n```python\n# 4 级下采样\nenc1 = DoubleConv(3, 64)\npool1 = MaxPool2d(2, 2)\n\nenc2 = DoubleConv(64, 128)\npool2 = MaxPool2d(2, 2)\n\nenc3 = DoubleConv(128, 256)\npool3 = MaxPool2d(2, 2)\n\nenc4 = DoubleConv(256, 512)\npool4 = MaxPool2d(2, 2)\n```\n\n**通道变化**: 3→64→128→256→512\n**尺寸变化**: H→H/2→H/4→H/8→H/16","x":2040,"y":105,"width":510,"height":490,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60005","type":"text","text":"## 核心组件 3: Decoder\n\n```python\n# 4 级上采样 + Skip Connection\nup4 = ConvTranspose2d(1024, 512, 2, 2)\nd4 = DoubleConv(1024, 512)  # cat后翻倍\n\nup3 = ConvTranspose2d(512, 256, 2, 2)\nd3 = DoubleConv(512, 256)\n\nup2 = ConvTranspose2d(256, 128, 2, 2)\nd2 = DoubleConv(256, 128)\n\nup1 = ConvTranspose2d(128, 64, 2, 2)\nd1 = DoubleConv(128, 64)\n```\n\n**关键**: ConvTranspose2d 上采样\n**cat**: encoder特征 + decoder特征","x":2960,"y":-280,"width":600,"height":495,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60012","type":"text","text":"## 超参数配置\n\n| 参数 | 值 |\n|------|----|\n| IMG_SIZE | 256x256 |\n| BATCH_SIZE | 4 |\n| NUM_EPOCHS | 60 |\n| LR | 2e-4 |\n| WEIGHT_DECAY | 1e-5 |\n| DICE_WEIGHT | 0.5 |\n| BCE_WEIGHT | 0.5 |\n| VAL_SPLIT | 0.2 |\n\n**优化器**: Adam\n**调度器**: StepLR (每20轮衰减0.5)","x":2960,"y":350,"width":440,"height":455,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60008","type":"text","text":"## 改进点速览\n\n**1. 动态尺寸填充**\n- forward 中自动检测尺寸\n- F.pad 零填充对齐\n- 兼容任意输入分辨率\n\n**2. 数据增强**\n- 训练时随机水平/垂直翻转\n- image/label/mask 三者同步\n\n**3. SafeDiceLoss**\n- smooth=1.0 (原 1e-6)\n- 更强数值稳定性\n\n**4. 独立推理**\n- 重新初始化干净模型\n- Normalize 预处理\n- ROI 掩码后处理\n- CUDA 同步计时","x":2960,"y":1183,"width":520,"height":660,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60007","type":"text","text":"## 核心组件 5: Dice Loss\n\n```python\nclass SafeDiceLoss(nn.Module):\n    # Dice = 2|X∩Y| / (|X|+|Y|)\n    # Loss = 1 - Dice\n    smooth = 1.0  # 数值稳定性\n```\n\n**为什么不用 BCE?**\n- 血管像素只占 ~10%\n- 模型偷懒全预测背景也能拿 90% 准确率\n- Dice Loss 直接监督\"重叠度\"\n- 不受类别不均衡影响\n\n**组合损失**:\n```\nloss = 0.5*BCE + 0.5*Dice\n```","x":2080,"y":1278,"width":510,"height":470,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60013","type":"text","text":"## 数据集: DRIVE\n\n**Digital Retinal Images for Vessel Extraction**\n\n- 训练集: 20 张眼底彩照\n- 测试集: 20 张眼底彩照\n- 标签: 手动标注的血管二值图\n- 掩码: FOV 视野范围\n\n**文件格式**:\n- 图像: .tif (RGB)\n- 标签: .gif (灰度)\n- 掩码: .gif (灰度)\n\n**血管像素占比**: ~10%\n**FOV 范围占比**: ~80%","x":2135,"y":2040,"width":400,"height":440,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"7014cafbe76c4602","type":"text","text":"","x":1077,"y":828,"width":250,"height":60},
